title: mistral-edge-voice
abstract: >-
  Full-duplex local voice agent stack for Mistral models (Voxtral Realtime,
  Ministral 3 14B, Voxtral TTS) on a single edge GPU. Developed for Intimate
  Triage, Ars Electronica 2026.
